  "translation": "Our family of three went to the supermarket together on Saturday morning. There were many things in the supermarket. I wanted to buy a book, Mom wanted to buy some fruit, and Dad also wanted to buy a piece of cake. There was a new cake shop over there. Dad asked, 'How much is this cake?' The clerk said, 'Twenty yuan.' Dad thought it was very expensive, but he still bought one piece. Then Mom said, 'We still need to buy a cup of juice.' She pointed to the left and said, 'The juice is over there.' Dad and I walked over together. The price of the juice was not high, so we quickly decided to buy this cup. After buying things, we came out of the supermarket. Today's shopping was very happy."
